WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:36.060
Awakening

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.320
Kamille, wait!

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:52.310
You sure?

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.350
Isn't it better if I go as well?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.960
Shinta and Qum
are looking after Rosammy.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.680
The children are babysitting Rosammy?

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.320
It'll be fine.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.360
They're in Dr. Hasan's office.

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:05.490
I guess.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.660
Kamille... about Miss Reccoa...?

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.830
Don't worry.
I'm not feeling down about it.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.140
<i>Fa! Kamille! There's a problem!</i>
<i>Rosammy's about to be dissected!</i>

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.180
It's Qum.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.370
Hurry!

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:26.650
- Shinta! Qum! Hold her legs for me!
- Nooo! No! No! No!

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.310
Ouch!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.510
Dr. Hasan!

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:31.520
Kamille!

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.920
Are you going to dissect Rosammy?!

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.220
Don't be silly!

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.220
These kids make a lot of fuss,
but won't help one bit!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.730
Dr. Hasan said he was going to
dissect Rosammy's body!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.400
I'm only doing a thorough checkup!

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.810
Yet Rosammy continues to refuse!

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.840
Is that true, Qum?

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:55.210
But anyone would think...!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:56.920
Rosammy.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.280
No!

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:00.850
Rosammy.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.420
You want to remain here on the Argama,
right?

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:07.160
Then you must let Dr. Hasan
give you a checkup.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:08.490
But why?!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.660
Y-You've got to if you want to
be with me from now on.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.030
Brother!

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.490
Listen...!

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.500
Kamille, we've got to get going!

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:18.500
Right.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:19.940
Okay, Rosammy?

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.770
Dr. Hasan gives us candy
whenever we have a checkup!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:24.910
Really?!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.310
Then I want a checkup, too!

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.850
What are you saying?!

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.450
Are you sure he won't do anything scary?

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.410
Of course not.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.780
You won't, will you?

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:37.150
Not much more than tap you
here and there, that's all.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.660
So I'll do it too!

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.760
You're a good girl, Qum.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.120
I'll do it, too!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.790
Okay, both of you, come over here.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.130
Okay!

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.690
Now, let me see your chest.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.000
Okay!

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:53.910
Okay!

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:55.800
Good. That's a good girl.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.370
Brother, where are you going?!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.780
I'll get in trouble if I don't work...

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.180
...while you're being
examined, Rosammy.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.040
Come and get me later!

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.150
Sure.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.320
- What was that for?!
- We'll be late for our meeting!

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.030
You may have participated
in a battle once or twice...

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:25.370
...but Ensign, it's not as if you've destroyed
the Argama or Zeta.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.200
- That's why I want you to...!
- Lead this poison gas operation, right?

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:32.970
If you're truly pledging loyalty to the Titans,
then prove it through this mission.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.610
I'm sure I can prove my loyalty
in other ways.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:40.850
Why must it be an operation
to release poison gas into a colony?

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.150
Don't flatter yourself!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.490
Your personal feelings
don't enter into it!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.890
This operation is extremely important...

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.400
...in order to suppress any defiance
by the A.E.U.G..

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:53.870
Yes, sir!

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:58.530
I'm sure you're well aware of
what punishment spies receive.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.340
I already consider myself
a member of the Titans!

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.230
Then do as I say!

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:08.010
- Proceed to standby at once!
- Yes, sir!

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.510
Ensign Reccoa.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.510
Sir?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.880
We are not a group of killers.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:18.190
Don't forget that we're wishing for peace
to arrive as soon as possible.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.220
Yes, sir!

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.890
"Wishing for peace?!"

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.570
Does Scirocco need to test me this way?

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:39.080
Any word?!

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:40.240
Sorry, I'm late!

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:42.780
Any results from
that girl's physical examination?

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.440
They just got started.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.610
I see.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:46.880
It'll be fine.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.750
Get the electromagnetic
current tester for me!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:49.790
Yes, sir!

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.320
- Here you are!
- Thank you!

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:55.760
Just because she's a good girl
doesn't mean she's on our side.

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.630
<i>Ensign Reccoa, are you ready?!</i>

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.840
<i>I'm ready to launch!</i>

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.310
<i>Captain Bask will be commanding</i>
<i>this operation personally!</i>

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.770
<i>Please execute it successfully</i>
<i>and prove your loyalty to the Titans!</i>

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.780
I intend to!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.950
Okay, that's good, Kamille!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:32.300
Thank you very much,
Chief Petty Officer Astonaige!

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:37.360
- Hey! You're on standby!
- I'll be right back!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.670
Orders to launch could come any time!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.740
Chief Petty Officer, check this for me!

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:42.600
Yes, sir!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.770
I gave you one the exact same size!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.470
Are you sure?

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:48.850
Hi!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.010
He said there's nothing wrong with me!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.980
I thought you might not return!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.620
- How was she?
- She was fine.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:57.950
Hey, want to lick it?

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:00.150
- Lick what?
- This!

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.120
No, thank you.
So, you got your candy.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.020
I got candy, too!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.430
- She can go now, right?
- Just a moment.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:10.470
There, I found one.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.230
A red one. Brother!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.460
I found a red candy!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.100
Not for me!

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:17.140
Don't you like candy?

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.300
S-Sure I like candy.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:19.740
Then here!

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:21.750
Here.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.740
Thank you.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.180
I have to launch now...

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.310
...so you just be a good girl and wait here.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.250
- Launch?
- Yeah.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.450
Now, put on your clothes.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.850
<i>Launch? In his pilot suit.</i>

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:43.260
There's something that I must hurry and do.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.840
She looks to be normal.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.600
Although that's a bit disappointing for me.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.140
Thank you very much.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.540
But there are still a number of tests
I must do...

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.540
...such as a doping test, and checking for
abnormalities in her cells.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:08:00.320
If people are attempting to create
and strengthen Newtypes artificially...

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.110
...we'd find irregularities in the genes.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.520
We'll also need to check
if she's been hypnotized.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.550
Is that why she's acting strangely?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.550
We can't be sure.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:11.460
Well, so far, she's just a normal girl.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:14.760
- Can I trust your words?
- Trust me!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.930
Right now, your mental state
is a lot more important.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.400
Right. Excuse me.

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:32.250
They've got a thick surveillance net up!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.580
Watch out!

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:39.860
Petersen!

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.120
- Time it with your vernier!
- <i>Too late!</i>

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.400
Now they know we're here.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.900
<i>But if the Argama arrives now...</i>

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.600
<i>...I won't have to execute</i>
<i>this dreadful operation.</i>

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.100
An emergency transmission from Side 2!

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:02.740
They've detected mobile-suit-like intruders!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.110
How many?!

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.710
I-it hasn't been confirmed yet!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.780
Send out our mobile suits,
from the ones on standby!

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.090
Roger!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.690
Rosammy, aren't you eating?

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.200
I hate... this sound...!

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.560
It's a signal that mobile suits are taking off.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.500
Oh, I see.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:29.670
It's cool to see
Kamille's Zeta Gundam launch!

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:33.140
Kamille? Zeta...!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.610
I can pilot mobile suits, too!

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.880
- No way!
- It's true!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:42.010
Everyone always tells me how good I am!

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.950
Then can you let us on, too?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.290
Sure! As long as there's
a mobile suit to pilot.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.620
Okay! This way!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.960
Not right now.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:56.490
I promised my brother
that I'd be a good girl and wait here.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.470
But you'll impress your brother
if you fight in a mobile suit.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:03.170
Yes! You're right!

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.730
Okay, let's go and help my brother!

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.070
<i>But what do you expect me to do?</i>

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.810
What's wrong, Torres?

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.510
<i>Dr. Hasan wants to talk to you.</i>

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.410
- <i>Put me through to Dr. Hasan!</i>
- R-Right!

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.120
<i>Dr. Hasan? Quattro here.</i>

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.350
Oh, Lieutenant!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.690
I can't find Rosammy anywhere.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.660
A result came up that worries me,
so I want to keep her here.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.320
<i>What result?</i>

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.260
Drugs were found in her blood cells.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.420
So she's a Cyber-Newtype?!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.430
There are traces
of that sort of doping.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:32.600
I can't confirm it, but...!

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:34.970
Aren't Qum and Shinta with her?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.440
<i>I believe they are together.</i>

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.000
All right! I'll be right over!

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:43.370
Lieutenant! You may go now!

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:45.850
Lieutenant Quattro?

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.320
Isn't he taking off?

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.050
<i>Kamille! Can you take off?!</i>

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.350
Y-Yes, sir!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.820
The enemy is approaching Colony 21.

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.790
Join the Mk. II and Methuss,
who have gone ahead...

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.850
...and stop the enemy!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:58.230
<i>Got that?!</i>

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.630
Roger! Zeta Gundam, taking off!

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.200
Lieutenant Quattro.
What happened?

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.920
<i>Isn't the Argama's mobile suit team</i>
<i>coming?!</i>

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:33.260
<i>At this rate, we'll be done</i>
<i>with our operation.</i>

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.800
<i>I thought the Argama was the best</i>
<i>force of the A.E.U.G.!</i>

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:38.430
Captain! It's from the Lieutenant!

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.500
It's me. What?

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:45.100
I see. Please.
Why at a time like this?

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:48.170
Have Lieutenant Emma
lead the mobile suit team!

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:59.820
Lieutenant Emma's leading?
What happened to Lt. Quattro?

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.840
They weren't in the normal suit room!

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.340
In that case, they should be here.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:21.140
- I'll look over here.
- Thanks.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:23.310
What'll we do?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.810
- Qum and I will attract their attention.
- Yeah?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.050
In the meantime,
you can board the Nemo, Rosammy.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.380
I get it! You're pretty smart!

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.320
Of course!

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:35.930
- Go on!
- What are we doing?

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:38.220
You run away and I'll chase you!

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:41.160
I'm always the bad guy.
I want to chase you!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.130
This isn't a game!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.690
That's right.
I'm going out to save my brother.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.970
The littlest always loses out!

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.530
What a lovely butt.

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:52.510
You can't tell with normal suits on!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.500
- Don't stop me!
- But you can't do it!

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.910
- What's the matter?!
- I'm going out in a mobile suit!

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.680
But you can't possibly fight!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.810
You shouldn't be here without a helmet!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.990
- Stop, Qum!
- No way!

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.150
You must go back! Both of you!

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:08.820
They're wearing normal suits?

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.360
Manack! Stop that person!

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.830
What?!

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.430
Rosammy! It's Rosammy, right?!

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:23.700
It's not the same one as I know.

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:26.640
But I can figure it out.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.940
I got it! This machine's quite simple.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.050
It's been locked from the inside!

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:39.390
Stop the elevator!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.550
Anybody!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.680
R-Right!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.990
Huh? It stopped!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.900
<i>Rosammy! Stop it!</i>

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.900
<i>Get out of that mobile suit at once!</i>

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:53.840
Why?!

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.400
Rosammy's on her way to assist Kamille!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:59.940
Look, Dr. Hasan.
She's moving it!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:02.840
You kids! Do you have any idea
what you're doing?!

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.910
Hyaku Shiki, taking off!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.090
Lieutenant! Don't do anything
while aboard the ship!

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.320
She mustn't get excited
and tear this place apart!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:16.060
I'll deal with this outside!

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:19.460
- <i>Rosammy's going out to help Kamille!</i>
- Roger.

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:22.430
If you get in the way,
I'll "correct" you later, Lieutenant!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.980
Come back, Rosammy!
If you don't, I'll fire!

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:35.940
He's going to fire at me?

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:37.880
That golden mobile suit?

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.280
She's giving me no choice.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.290
Rosammy!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:51.650
She's got to be a Cyber-Newtype
to move like that.

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:55.860
<i>Ensign Reccoa!</i>
<i>Preparations are complete!</i>

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.430
Are the colony defense forces
wiped out?!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.560
<i>Ensign Reccoa! Preparations</i>
<i>to release the gas are complete!</i>

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:05.280
We're releasing gas into the colony...!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:07.680
<i>Ensign!</i>

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.010
O-Okay.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.500
What's this?!

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.360
Kamille! What's wrong?!

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:36.540
Didn't you feel it, Lieutenant Emma?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:38.300
Feel it?

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.540
Feel what?

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.080
How would I explain it?

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:44.880
Like a thousand awful feelings
just tore through my body.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.520
<i>Very unpleasant. I feel like throwing up.</i>

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.850
Get a hold of yourself.
The enemy's near by!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.080
What?

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.180
I just felt something awful.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:01.460
Enemy ahead of us in Colony 21!

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:02.500
<i>Roger!</i>

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.740
That sensation was a result
of this poison gas!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.750
You're not having it your way!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.380
I hope I made it in time.

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:32.020
No, it's too late.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.090
You're late! You guys were too late!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:44.530
That Messala!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.080
Is it Ensign Reccoa?!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.810
You pest! Don't get in my way!

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:56.880
Say something!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.580
Are you Ensign Reccoa?!

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:00.480
Why won't you answer?

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:02.250
Then I must be right!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:06.550
How could you be part of
this gruesome operation?!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:07.790
Why?!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.660
Children like you will never understand that.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.330
If you're this slow to react in battle,
you'll never defeat Scirocco!

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.870
A beam saber?

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.400
I'll never understand!

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.810
And I'll never forgive you!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:24.750
Once you die, I'm sure you can't
forgive anyone, little boy!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:25.980
Damn you!

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.250
Can you do anything just because
you're an adult?!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.190
You're hiding behind
lame excuses!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:34.750
<i>Brother!</i>

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:35.850
What was that?

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.300
I hurried straight here, Brother!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.600
You got here in a Nemo?

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.200
Rosammy! How in the world?!

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:55.810
I hit it!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.040
She defeated a Hizack? Rosammy did?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.980
Great teamwork!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.480
However...!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.550
L-Lieutenant Quattro!

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:15.330
Rosammy! A mobile suit battle is no game!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.430
<i>But you're doing the same thing, brother!</i>

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.270
<i>I can't believe she's</i>
<i>a Cyber-Newtype.</i>

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:28.840
At this stage,
I won't bother asking you why.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.150
Lieutenant.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.150
You're always like that.

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:35.210
You always insist on looking
down on everyone!

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:38.520
Is that your reason, Ensign Reccoa?

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.050
In that case...

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.890
...let me be the one to
put an end to your troubles!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:50.000
Don't think for a moment
that the world revolves around you!

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:51.430
Char!

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:57.540
Listen! You mustn't move from here!

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:59.670
And you mustn't open your visor!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:00.680
Why not?

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.510
Something's strange about this colony!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:03.740
It's been contaminated with gas!

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.370
Shinta! Qum!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:08.510
Hey, what's wrong?

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:10.490
Oh, you're not Shinta.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.720
Hey you, wake up! Come on!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:16.390
Rosammy, he's dead. You can stop that.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.530
Why? I won't stop!

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.720
Wake up! I'm telling you to wake up!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.860
Rosammy, you stay here!

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.410
Damn Titans!

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:31.910
Brother?

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.310
Say goodbye!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:57.530
The sky... is... falling...!

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.810
How could you kill people so easily?!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.650
You deserve to die! Die!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.300
Where's Rosammy?

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:32.800
Rosammy!

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:38.270
Rosammy, what's wrong?!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.810
<i>The Zeta Gundam</i>
<i>will bring the skies down.</i>

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.710
What are you talking about, Rosammy?!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.810
You're an enemy!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:49.590
Rosammy!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.690
I am Lieutenant Rosamia Badam!

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:56.320
My orders are to destroy the Zeta Gundam
and eliminate its pilot!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.190
Stop it, Rosammy!

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:09.770
Kamille!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.840
Miss Emma! Stop it!

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.800
That's Rosammy!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:17.870
I know!

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:19.920
She's a Titans Cyber-Newtype!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.150
<i>I just got word from the Argama.</i>

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.740
But that's Rosammy!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.520
Two Gundams?!

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:28.820
<i>Lieutenant Rosamia Badam!</i>

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.590
<i>Can you hear me?! Rosamia Badam!</i>

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.330
I missed again!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.130
Why can't I destroy it?!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.690
Am I hesitating for some reason?!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:43.210
I'm the one destined to defeat you, Char!

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:45.970
<i>G3 unit, join Lieutenant Rosamia...</i>

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.980
<i>...and return to the ship at once!</i>

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:53.650
Rosammy!!

00:21:55.690 --> 00:21:56.880
Stop it!

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:58.210
It's no use chasing after her!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:10.930
Kamille.

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:16.330
Thankfully, that girl has left.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:31.920
Once again, a tragedy
has made its mark in space.

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:37.580
And this also marks
the beginning of the next tragedy.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.030 --> 00:23:51.330
Rosamia now pilots the Baund Doc,
and is sent out into Side 2 airspace.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:56.760
Upon encountering the machine, Kamille
tries to bring Rosamia back with him...

00:23:57.170 --> 00:24:00.610
...but Rosamia disappears
from Kamille's sight.

00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:06.970
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Goodbye, Rosammy."

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Goodbye, Rosammy

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:10.350
You will see the tears of time.
